r each non-releasable bird’s story.","short_summary":"A self-guided viewing route with resident raptors and a museum.","evidence_claim":"The California Raptor Center states that its self-guided tours, including its raptor route and museum, have free admission.","source_url":"https://crc.vetmed.ucdavis.edu/visit","source_title":"Plan Your Visit — California Raptor Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Visiting hours are 9 a.m.–4 p.m. Monday–Friday and 9 a.m.–noon Saturday–Sunday; closed university holidays.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ucd-egghead-art-walk","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Egghead Art Walk","title":"Find all five Eggheads","subtitle":"UC Davis campus","notes":"Open the Arts at UC Davis interactive map, walk to each installation, and scan the labels’ QR codes for the background.","short_summary":"A self-guided campus art walk linking five Egghead installations.","evidence_claim":"UC Davis provides an Egghead Art Walk using its interactive map and says all five installations have informational labels and QR codes.","source_url":"https://www.ucdavis.edu/events/eggheads-self-guided-tours","source_title":"Take a Self-Guided Campus Art Tour — UC Davis","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2024-04-05","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The listed self-guided-tour event runs 8 a.m.–8 p.m.; stay on public campus routes and observe building access rules.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ucd-east-asian-collection-picnic","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"East Asian Collection","title":"Pause by Lake Spafford","subtitle":"East Asian Collection, UC Davis Arboretum","notes":"Bring a no-purchase picnic or simply sit on the open lawn, taking in the lake view and seasonal trees from the paths.","short_summary":"An Arboretum collection with lawns, Lake Spafford views, and seasonal plant interest.","evidence_claim":"UC Davis describes the East Asian Collection as an Arboretum destination with open lawns and views of Lake Spafford; the Arboretum states there is no charge to visit its gardens.","source_url":"https://campusgrown.ucdavis.edu/visit","source_title":"Visit and Explore — UC Davis Arboretum and Public Garden","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The broader Arboretum gardens are open 24 hours daily; avoid reserved areas and note that weekday vehicle parking may cost extra.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
